"사본이","x":844,"y":799,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"있는","x":951,"y":800,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"시스템만","x":1025,"y":800,"width":129,"height":35},{"text":"사본을","x":1168,"y":800,"width":101,"height":35},{"text":"통해","x":1283,"y":801,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"빠르게","x":1366,"y":801,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"액","x":1480,"y":803,"width":27,"height":34}]},{"text":"세스 할 수 있다. 데이터에 대한 계산은 해당 시스템에서 발생하며 결과는 네트워크를","words":[{"text":"세스","x":281,"y":857,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"할","x":356,"y":857,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":400,"y":858,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":447,"y":858,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"데이터에","x":527,"y":858,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"대한","x":658,"y":857,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"계산은","x":732,"y":857,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"해당","x":834,"y":858,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"시스템에서","x":909,"y":858,"width":151,"height":35},{"text":"발생하며","x":1080,"y":859,"width":127,"height":35},{"text":"결과는","x":1230,"y":859,"width":100,"height":35},{"text":"네트워크를","x":1348,"y":860,"width":163,"height":35}]},{"text":"통해(예: 요청한 시스템으로) 전송된다. 다른 시스템은 객체를 읽고 쓰려면 네트워크 연","words":[{"text":"통해(예:","x":280,"y":916,"width":110,"height":38},{"text":"요청한","x":404,"y":917,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"시스템으로)","x":508,"y":917,"width":154,"height":37},{"text":"전송된다.","x":678,"y":916,"width":123,"height":35},{"text":"다른","x":816,"y":917,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"시스템은","x":889,"y":917,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"객체를","x":1028,"y":917,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"읽고","x":1138,"y":917,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"쓰려면","x":1216,"y":918,"width":101,"height":34},{"text":"네트워크","x":1334,"y":918,"width":132,"height":34},{"text":"연","x":1481,"y":919,"width":27,"height":34}]},{"text":"결이 필요하다. 따라서 객체 저장소는 일반적으로 고속 랜덤 액세스가 아닌 대량 저장장","words":[{"text":"결이","x":282,"y":974,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"필요하다.","x":354,"y":975,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"따라서","x":493,"y":975,"width":84,"he